      "comment" : "Summary subtitle when some charges stuck and some were reversed; %1$lld is roubles charged, %2$lld the reversed count.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Сегодня списано %1$lld ₽. Не состоявшихся откладываний: %2$lld — деньги за них вернули."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "woke_morning.subtitle.reversed_none" : {
      "comment" : "Summary subtitle when every charge was reversed; %lld is the reversed count. Kept whole rather than assembled from a lead-in plus a shared tail, so the two sentences can be reordered per language.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Списаний не осталось. Не состоявшихся откладываний: %lld — деньги за них вернули."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "woke_morning.subtitle.unavailable" : {
      "comment" : "Summary subtitle when the transaction ledger could not be read. Says so instead of printing a number nobody verified.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Историю списаний прочитать не удалось, поэтому сумму за это утро мы не показываем. Текущий баланс — на главном экране."
          }
        }
      }
    }
